 },
 "foreign_words": [],
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "hook",
   "text": "What if the Moon suddenly started {falling} toward Earth?",
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "breath",
   "text": "At first, it would look {breathtaking}.",
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "giant",
   "text": "A {gigantic Moon} dominating the night sky.",
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "pull",
   "text": "But the {closer} it came, the more {dangerous} its gravitational pull would become.",
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "tides",
   "text": "{Extreme tides} could {flood} coastal cities.",
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "tear",
   "text": "Powerful tidal forces could {tear the Moon apart}, creating an enormous {ring of debris} around Earth.",
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "debris",
   "text": "Some of that {debris} could {rain down} on our planet.",
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "collide",
   "text": "And if a {collision} occurred, the energy released could {devastate} Earth's surface.",
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "blue",
   "text": "Our familiar {blue planet} might become an {unrecognizable} world.",
   "pause_after": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "final",
   "text": "The Moon looks {peaceful} tonight. But imagine if it started getting {closer}.",
   "pause_after": 0.2
  }
 ],
